  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting community-based recovery of agricultural livelihoods and strengthening of agri-food value chains in war-affected areas of Sumska oblast (PERAL Sumska)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the productivity of rural farming communities and improve selected value chains in Sumska oblast in order to ensure improved 
opportunities to revamp rural livelihoods and foster community-based recovery whilst stabilizing production of staple food within the targeted hromadas.</narrative>
  </description>
